<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <style>
      * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing: border-box; } body { font-family:
      -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue",
      Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.7; color: #000000; font-size: 20px; }
      header { background-color: #FFC726; padding: 24px 16px; } header
      .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; } .container {
      max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px 16px; } footer {
      background-color: #00267F; color: #ffffff; padding: 24px 16px; font-size:
      14px; } footer .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0;
      } footer p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; } h1 { color: #000000;
      font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom:
      32px; } h2 { color: #000000; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 16px; } .section { margin-bottom: 32px; }
      p { margin: 16px 0; } .submission-id { background-color: #f0f8ff;
      padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #00267F; margin: 20px 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class='container'>
        <strong>Government of Barbados</strong>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class='container'>
      <h1>Thank you for your application</h1>
  <p>Your information has been sent to the National Conservation Commission (NCC)</p>
      
      <div class='submission-id'>
        <p><strong>Your Submission ID:</strong> {{submissionId}}</p>
        <p>Please save this ID for your records.</p>
      </div>

      <div class='section'>
        <h2>What happens next</h2>
        <p>You will meet with representatives from the NCC at the location where you would like to sell goods or services. They will assess suitability.</p>
        <p>If the outcome is positive, you will need to visit the National Conservation Commission to collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A letter of authorisation.</li>
          <li>A licence book outlining the conditions of where and what you can sell.</li>
          <li>Your vendor identification.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class='section'>
        <h2>Pay for your license</h2>
        <p>You can pay for your vendor documentation in cash or by card when you visit the NCC.</p>
        <p>The prices include VAT.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Licence: $117.50 </li>
          <li>A watersports licence costs $176.25 </li>
          <li>Licence book: $11.75 </li>
          <li>ID badge: $12.87 </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div class='container'>
        <p>Government of Barbados<br />
          This is an automated confirmation email. Please do not reply.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
